# The repository is authored on Windows and consumed on Linux and macOS. LF in
# the repository is not a preference here: install.sh is fetched and piped
# straight into sh, and a CRLF in that file makes the shebang and every command
# fail on the machines it is meant to run on.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
